 are followed in order: authenticate user, verify order status, find new items, and perform the exchange with confirmation. Each step requires a tool call, and I must wait for user confirmation before proceeding with any exchange.\n</think>\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"find_user_id_by_name_zip\", \"arguments\": {\"first_name\": \"Yusuf\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\", \"zip\": \"19122\"}}\n",
